message: "If you build on this work, please cite it as below."
title: "roomba-signal-mapping"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Young
    given-names: Michael
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-7442-2986"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AlakazipLabs/roomba-signal-mapping"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A methodology for mapping and locating a camera-less robot vacuum by
  layering weak ambient signals (robot telemetry, household RF, fixed
  sensors) and interpreting them against consumer-LiDAR ground truth,
  entirely outside the robot.
